    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>VR HOT</strong> is a digital experience that allows you to create and interact with dream partners in VR and through a limited Desktop Mode. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Explore your most intimate desires in VR HOT, featuring fully immersive virtual environments and a construction kit to create and interact with your dream partners.<br>   </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Embodiment</strong><br>Experience a fully customizable virtual body (male or female). You\u2019re not just a pair of floating gloves\u2014you\u2019re a complete, interactive presence.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Interaction</strong><br>Your dream partner isn\u2019t just a static doll. They talk, move, and respond dynamically to your actions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Voice Commands</strong><br>Communicate naturally by using the in-game menu or simply telling your partner what you want.<br><strong>Innovative Physics System</strong><br>Enjoy lifelike interactions with a cutting-edge system that seamlessly blends state-of-the-art physics and animations.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Thrust Control</strong><br>Take immersion to the next level by using your controller to track your hip movements.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Customizability</strong><br>Design and save your own unique characters\u2014male, female or intersex (to an extent).</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Socialize</strong><br>Share your creations and discover new \u201cHotties\u201d through our Discord community.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Limited Desktop Mode </strong><strong></strong>Perfect for character editing without a VR headset! Please note that the Desktop Mode is still under development and doesn\u2019t  offer the full functionality of VR mode. We are actively working toward (near) feature parity between the two modes.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong><br>Environments</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Explore five unique settings to interact with your dream partners:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Room with a View</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Single Bedroom</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Minimal Room</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Dungeon</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Tropical Island</strong><br>Additionally a &quot;Green Room&quot; for a simple MR mode (only for users of the software &quot;Virtual Desktop&quot;!).<br> </p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Additional Features</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Vive Tracker Support</strong><br>Connect Vive trackers to the Player body, your Hottie, or movable objects like toys, pillows, or chairs.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Teledildonics</strong><br>Integrate compatible toys to feel what you see.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Hand Tracking</strong><br>Ditch the controllers (most of the time) and use your real hands for interactions. This experimental feature works with select headsets.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong><br>Inclusivity and Diversity</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Play as a male or female character with male or female partners.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Create intersex characters to an extent.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Discover greater diversity with a range of ethnically varied options.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Our Ethical Commitment</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">We stand firmly for consent. VR HOT promotes only consensual interactions between adults, ensuring a safe and respectful environment.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>VR HOT</strong> is a digital experience that allows you to create and interact with dream partners in VR and through a limited Desktop Mode. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Explore your most intimate desires in VR HOT, featuring fully immersive virtual environments and a construction kit to create and interact with your dream partners.<br>   </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Embodiment</strong><br>Experience a fully customizable virtual body (male or female). You\u2019re not just a pair of floating gloves\u2014you\u2019re a complete, interactive presence.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Interaction</strong><br>Your dream partner isn\u2019t just a static doll. They talk, move, and respond dynamically to your actions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Voice Commands</strong><br>Communicate naturally by using the in-game menu or simply telling your partner what you want.<br><strong>Innovative Physics System</strong><br>Enjoy lifelike interactions with a cutting-edge system that seamlessly blends state-of-the-art physics and animations.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Thrust Control</strong><br>Take immersion to the next level by using your controller to track your hip movements.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Customizability</strong><br>Design and save your own unique characters\u2014male, female or intersex (to an extent).</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Socialize</strong><br>Share your creations and discover new \u201cHotties\u201d through our Discord community.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Limited Desktop Mode </strong><strong></strong>Perfect for character editing without a VR headset! Please note that the Desktop Mode is still under development and doesn\u2019t  offer the full functionality of VR mode. We are actively working toward (near) feature parity between the two modes.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong><br>Environments</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Explore five unique settings to interact with your dream partners:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Room with a View</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Single Bedroom</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Minimal Room</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Dungeon</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Tropical Island</strong><br>Additionally a &quot;Green Room&quot; for a simple MR mode (only for users of the software &quot;Virtual Desktop&quot;!).<br> </p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Additional Features</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Vive Tracker Support</strong><br>Connect Vive trackers to the Player body, your Hottie, or movable objects like toys, pillows, or chairs.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Teledildonics</strong><br>Integrate compatible toys to feel what you see.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Hand Tracking</strong><br>Ditch the controllers (most of the time) and use your real hands for interactions. This experimental feature works with select headsets.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong><br>Inclusivity and Diversity</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Play as a male or female character with male or female partners.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Create intersex characters to an extent.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Discover greater diversity with a range of ethnically varied options.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Our Ethical Commitment</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">We stand firmly for consent. VR HOT promotes only consensual interactions between adults, ensuring a safe and respectful environment.</p>",
